    skos:prefLabel "Cant Frame"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "A piece of timber set at an oblique angle rather than at right angles to the keel. Cant frames are found at both ends of the vessel, those at the bows incline toward the stem post and those at the stern incline toward the sternpost."@en .

<http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/572/concepts/146543> a skos:Concept ;
