<http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/572/concepts/146496> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/572/concepts/146994> ;
    skos:inScheme <http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/572> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Block"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "A pulley, comprising a shell, sheave and pin, through which a rope passes. Blocks are used for various purposes but particularly to increase the mechanical power of ropes used in working the sails."@en .

<http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/572/concepts/146667> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/572/concepts/147012> ;
    skos:inScheme <http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/572> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fore And Aft Sail"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Any sail which is rigged so that the luff of the sail abuts the mast or is attached to a stay. The sail can be extended by a boom at the foot and a gaff at the head or by a single sprit or yard."@en .

<http://purl.org/heritagedata/schemes/572/concepts/146983> a skos:Concept ;
